     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Hello,</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">  I am trying to fit a linear\r\nmeta-regression model to a relatively small data set (154 observations with\r\nfour categorical predictors).  When I fit the model in rstan, I\r\nconsistently receive the warning &quot;There were X divergent transitions after\r\nwarmup&quot; for values of X typically between 1 and 10.  Following advice\r\nfrom other posts on this topic, I have increased adapt_delta to 0.999,\r\ndecreased stepsize to 0.001, and increased max_treedepth to 18.  I have\r\nalso made the priors more informative.  The current Stan model is:<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">data{</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">   int&lt;lower=1&gt; N;    </span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">   int&lt;lower=1&gt; nAs;</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">   int&lt;lower=1&gt; nBs;</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">   int&lt;lower=1&gt; nCs;</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">   int&lt;lower=1&gt; nDs;</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\"><br></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-