d and revise accordingly?<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Gratefully yours,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Lauren<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">&gt; sessionInfo()<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">R version 3.2.4 Revised (2016-03-16 r70336)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Platform: x86_64-w64