>loaded via a namespace (and not attached):<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> [1] Rcpp_0.12.3    \r\n codetools_0.2-14 grid_3.2.4       gtable_0.2.0  \r\n  stats4_3.2.4     magrittr_1.5     scales_0.4.0\r\n    stringi_1.0-1    tools_3.2.4     <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">[10] stringr_1.0.0    munsell_0.4.3\r\n   inline_0.3.14    colorspace_1.2-6 gridExtra_2.2.1 <u></u><u></u></span></p></div>"
